    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy &amp; Data Protection</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_button">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_summary">Your academic data (profile, quizzes, course progress, and private messages) is protected, used solely for SVT learning, and never sold or shared for commercial purposes.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">Last updated: 2026\n\n1. Application Controller\nBioTerre SVT is an educational application created in 2026 by Ayman BIROUK (contact: biroukayman@gmail.com).\n\n2. Data Collected &amp; Educational Purpose\nThe app only processes data required for classroom management and learning progress:\n• Account &amp; identity: full name, role (student or teacher), Massar ID (student), professional email (teacher), optional phone number and birth date.\n• Academic activity: class enrollment, quiz scores and timing, video watch percentage, file opening status, private student-teacher messages, and earned badges.\n• Offline storage: downloaded resources are stored locally on your device.\n\n3. Device Permissions\n• Camera: used exclusively to scan class QR Codes. No personal photos or videos are recorded or uploaded.\n• Notifications: used to alert you about new courses, quizzes, announcements, messages, and badges.\n• Files &amp; gallery: access is strictly limited to files manually chosen through the secure system picker.\n\n4. Security &amp; Confidentiality\n• Strict per-class and per-user access rules: students only access resources for their enrolled class.\n• Private messaging is strictly confidential between each student and their teacher.\n• No ads, no advertising trackers, and no sale or commercial sharing of personal data.\n\n5. Retention &amp; Your Rights\nYou can view and update your profile details in the Profile tab. Removing a student or class deletes associated records. For any data protection request, contact: biroukayman@gmail.com.</string>
    <string name="terms_of_use_title">Terms of Use</string>
    <string name="terms_of_use_button">Terms of Use</string>
    <string name="terms_of_use_summary">Rules for class access, educational use of resources, and respectful conduct between students and teachers on BioTerre SVT.</string>
    <string name="terms_of_use_body">Last updated: 2026\n\n1. Purpose &amp; Acceptance\nThese Terms of Use govern access to and use of the BioTerre SVT educational application (created in 2026 by Ayman BIROUK). Using the application constitutes acceptance of these terms.\n\n2. Accounts &amp; Class Access\n• Teachers: create and manage their classes, resources, quizzes, student rosters, and class QR/access codes.\n• Students: join their class using their Massar ID or the class QR Code / secret code provided by their teacher.\n• Users must keep their login credentials confidential and provide accurate information.\n\n3. Educational Use &amp; Conduct\n• The application is reserved strictly for SVT learning and classroom follow-up.\n• Messages and submitted activities must remain respectful and appropriate for an educational environment.\n• Uploading unlawful content, disrupting the service, or attempting to access another class or student\'s data is prohibited.\n\n4. Content &amp; Intellectual Property\n• The BioTerre SVT software, design, and brand belong to its creator Ayman BIROUK (2026).\n• Courses, videos, documents, and quizzes remain under the educational responsibility of the teachers who publish them.\n\n5. Availability &amp; Updates\nThe application supports offline access for previously downloaded resources. Updates may be released to improve stability and security.\n\n6. Contact\nFor any questions regarding these terms: biroukayman@gmail.com.</string>
